uest this one in the same vein.\n\nCharacter\nRain Patterson (Niji-sanji)\nShe is wearing a normal costume with no shirt (nouveau bra?) under her chest. is missing from the beginning.\n\nComposition perspective:\nViewpoint looking at Lane Patterson sitting across the desk in front of her.\n\nCondition\nHis face is covered with semen, possibly from being shot in the face.\nSuspenders have been shifted behind his chest, and his right breast is being rubbed by a fan with his left hand supporting the breast from below as his shirt is shifted down, with a small amount of juice oozing from the nipple.\nThe left breast is covered by the shirt, but is moistened by saliva from being sucked by the person in front of her, so the breast is visible.\nLane Patterson is rubbing her own left breast, producing mother's milk through her clothes and pouring it into a cup.\n\nOn the desk is a cup into which breast milk is being poured and a milking machine (a simple transparent tube with a tube attached will do).\n\n\n\n■Situation Content\nA Thanksgiving event with the same content as \"A fan appreciation event where you can do whatever you want to the lifers as long as you don't go over the desk that was posted.\"\nA conversation is going on with a fan who has taken his turn and Lane Patterson is being tossed around.\nThe following conversation balloons in the above character's state.\n\n(1) Upper right\nFan \"Looking forward to it, wow, it's already amazing.\"\nLe \"Oh no - it's really terrible how relentless everyone is... Oh, how about a drink for you too? Service from Patachi!\"\n\n(2) Lower right\nFan \"Oh, you're going to breastfeed? Of course, with pleasure! I do have long and magnificent tits that look like they will come out... (firs)\".\nLe \"You guys really like tits~, I heard it goes away in a day after you drink the food I gave you, but the tingling doesn't stop... Some of you even drink directly from your clothes, it's so sticky\".\n\n\n(3) Top left\nFan \"Patachi was allowed to bring in naughty things by the rules.\nLe \"The previous person brought anal beads and showed me how to put them in... Hey, you're not so bad yourself, are you? Do you want to turn Patachi into a cow?\n\n\n(4) Bottom left\nFan \"I was going to ask you to wear this for the checkers, but now I'm getting mother's milk...\" (5) Bottom left\nLe \"Oh my God - I can't help it, I don't know how to put it on without shiko...\"\n\n\n\nIf you need to change the length of the dialogue, you can adjust it without changing it.\n\n\nThank you for your consideration.", "nc": 40, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@sorryTeng/works/13", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1693942, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/ae938774/uploads/origins/340359c1-3313-4665-a6a8-3702ab9d1c23?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d97e8fcb45254a7b9e758f8ec58f2edc", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ae938774/uploads/origins/340359c1-3313-4665-a6a8-3702ab9d1c23?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d97e8fcb45254a7b9e758f8ec58f2edc, https://si.imgix.net/ae938774/uploads/origins/340359c1-3313-4665-a6a8-3702ab9d1c23?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3d26f138f1c42b22e2ae268f34fb91b8 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ae938774/uploads/origins/340359c1-3313-4665-a6a8-3702ab9d1c23?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c1e320f4a561a83e4d454fd0936623d3 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": true, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/ae938774/uploads/origins/340359c1-3313-4665-a6a8-3702ab9d1c23?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=86eb38a1dde87abe43f7151297960049", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ae938774/uploads/origins/340359